{"id":"a080581455fc9863","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal7 Chain Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Chain Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Chain Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","[[58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Chain Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset.md\">58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\mathcal I \\in V\">\\(P,\\mathcal I \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R \\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(R \\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ChainIdeal}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ChainIdeal}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}chain\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ChainIdeal}_S(P,R,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathcal P(P)^n\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in n}C(i)\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{Chain}(C(i),P,R)\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}chain\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ChainIdeal}_S(P,R,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathcal P(P)^n\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in n}C(i)\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{Chain}(C(i),P,R)\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The family of individual chains is not closed under finite unions. The chain ideal therefore consists of subsets covered by finitely many chains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\mathcal I \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R \\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ChainIdeal}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chain}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}chain\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ChainIdeal}_S(P,R,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathcal P(P)^n\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in n}C(i)\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{Chain}(C(i),P,R)\\right)\\right\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1036,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-ideal7-chain-ideal]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a07664003abe8d32","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}